@startuml
' Turritopsis ESG Diagnostic | repository inspection 2026-10-07
' Scope: Application — implemented workflow patterns
' Evidence: backend/src/Modules/Turritopsis.Modules.Reviews.Core/Domain/DossierStates.cs; backend/src/Modules/Turritopsis.Modules.Reviews.Core/Domain/Dossier.cs; backend/src/Modules/Turritopsis.Modules.Reviews.Core/Application/DossierCommands.cs
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #30465E
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F3F6FA
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F3F6FA
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F3F6FA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF5DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #C79C56
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide empty members
title Dossier lifecycle and enforced transitions
state "Editable answers\n(no persisted Draft)" as Draft
state Submitted
state InReview
state Rejected
state Validated
[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Submitted : submit / freeze answers
Submitted --> Submitted : resubmit / reset old review
Submitted --> InReview : reviewer starts review
Submitted --> Validated : reviewer validates / score required
Submitted --> Rejected : reviewer rejects
InReview --> InReview : update review
InReview --> Validated : reviewer validates
InReview --> Rejected : reviewer rejects
Rejected --> Submitted : company corrects / resubmits
Validated --> [*] : immutable closed dossier
note right of Validated
 A new company submission creates a separate dossier.
 This validated row cannot change or receive notes.
end note
note left of InReview
 Company resubmission returns 409 during review.
 Stale concurrent writes return 409.
 Invalid scores / status values return 400.
end note
@enduml
